[COMMAND]:      image.info
[PACKAGE]:      IMAGE
[USE]:          dock -image info

[OUT]:          Shows all the information related to the parent image of the container of 
                the current directory.

[ACTIONS]:      INFO=$(docker image inspect -f "{{.$PARAM}}" $IMAGE_FULL_NAME)
                echo $INFO

[NOTES]:        More information available in the image.sh script.
